@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+---
+id: task-002-correct-order-discounts-coupon-dates-and-shipping-vat
+type: task
+title: "Correct order discounts coupon dates and shipping VAT"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Correct the three reported pricing defects in the order service:
+
+- Percentage coupons apply to the subtotal after volume discounts.
+- A coupon remains redeemable through its `validUntil` calendar day.
+- Delivery is VAT-exempt, including on receipts and invoice VAT summaries.
+
+Add focused regression coverage and update the published business rules to match the corrected
+behaviour.
